"For maximum effectiveness, bring your device inside and connect to a good USB-C adapter and Wi-Fi weekly.\n"
"\n"
"Firehose Mode can also work while you're driving if connected to a hotspot or unlimited SIM card."
msgstr ""
"為了達到最佳效果，請每週將裝置帶進室內，接上良好的 USB-C 充電器並連上 Wi-Fi。\n"
"\n"
"若連接熱點或使用吃到飽的 SIM 卡，Firehose 模式在行駛中也能運作。"

